---
---

<section class="hero-section animate-fade-in">
  <div class="hero-badge">
    <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
    <span class="badge-text">SOFTWARE CRAFTSMANSHIP & INDUSTRIAL IoT</span>
  </div>
  
  <h1 class="hero-title">
    Sistemas Críticos & Telemetría <span class="gradient-text-glow">PaaS</span> para la Alta Industria
  </h1>
  
  <p class="hero-subtitle">
    En <strong class="highlight-company">CodeCraft Perú</strong> transformamos la complejidad operativa minera en soluciones digitales simples y de altísima precisión. Conectamos infraestructura física con backends distribuidos en <span class="highlight-tech">Spring Boot</span>, interfaces en <span class="highlight-tech">Angular</span> y telemetría de alto rendimiento en <span class="highlight-tech">Rust</span>.
  </p>
  
  <div class="hero-ctas">
    <a href="#paas-suite" class="btn-premium btn-primary-glow">
      <span class="btn-text">Ver Soluciones PaaS</span>
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="btn-icon" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 13l-7 7-7-7m14-6l-7 7-7-7" />
      </svg>
    </a>
    <a href="#contacto" class="btn-premium btn-secondary">
      Cotizar Proyecto B2B
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 100px 20px 80px 20px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: rgba(220, 68, 68, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(220, 68, 68, 0.2);
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }

  .pulse-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background-color: rgb(220, 68, 68);
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(220, 68, 68, 0.8);
    animation: pulse 1.5s infinite alternate;
  }

  .badge-text {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: rgb(240, 100, 100);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 54px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .gradient-text-glow {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b6b 0%, #ff8e8e 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    position: relative;
    text-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(220, 68, 68, 0.25);
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .highlight-company {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .highlight-tech {
    color: #eaeaea;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .hero-ctas {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  /* Efecto de Brillo de Acento del Botón Principal */
  .btn-primary-glow {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(220, 68, 68, 0.2) 0%, rgba(220, 68, 68, 0.05) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(220, 68, 68, 0.4);
    color: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(220, 68, 68, 0.15);
  }

  .btn-primary-glow:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(220, 68, 68, 0.3) 0%, rgba(220, 68, 68, 0.1) 100%);
    border-color: rgba(220, 68, 68, 0.6);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(220, 68, 68, 0.3);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .btn-icon {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary-glow:hover .btn-icon {
    transform: translateY(3px);
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0% { transform: scale(0.9); opacity: 0.5; }
    100% { transform: scale(1.2); opacity: 1; }
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-section {
      padding-top: 60px;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 38px;
    }
    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    .highlight-tech {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }
</style>
